                                                  "mac-pinning" (  /* Enable (TRUE) or disable (FALSE). There are scenarios in which it is desired to configure some MAC addresses as static so that they are not subjected to MAC moves. If you enable MAC pinning on a CE interface, that MAC address cannot be moved to any other CE interface */
                                                    ("true" | "false")
