                              c(
                                  "connection-point" (  /* A connection point within a Layer 2 network instance. Each connection-point consists of a set of interfaces only one of which is active at any one time. Other than the specification of whether an interface is local (i.e., exists within this network-instance), or remote, all configuration and state parameters are common */
                                      s(
